OL,3,GNEWSAVictims 'frustrated' as abusive
OL,4,Ateacher spared more jail time
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims have said they are frustrated
OL,7,Fand angry after an ex-teacher found
OL,8,Fguilty of sexually abusing five pupils
OL,9,Fin the 1980s has not had his sentence
OL,10,Fextended.
OL,12,FPaul Stainsby, 76, was jailed for 14
OL,13,Fyears in 2022 for sexual offences
OL,14,Fcommitted while teaching at a school in
OL,15,FEssex in the 1970s.
OL,17,FA jury at Warwick Crown Court on
OL,18,FTuesday found him guilty of 10 more
OL,19,Foffences involving five former pupils
OL,20,Fof the Warwick School in Warwickshire,
OL,21,Ffollowing a trial of facts.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
